{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dig Down",
    "steam_appid": 2227500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/6c24889f4e6546010460e650c05fcc7e.poster.avif?t=1714651882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/6c24889f4e6546010460e650c05fcc7e.webm?t=1714651882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/6c24889f4e6546010460e650c05fcc7e.mp4?t=1714651882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dig Down is a fun and challenging digging and treasure-hunting roguelike adventure game.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/b2b6203c90de68aa634b905dedc3531a.avif?t=1714651882\" /></div><br><br>In each world you visit, you must dig as deep as possible before either your pick loses durability and breaks or you run out of time and get crushed. Each dig will see you face increasingly challenging monsters, traps and the opportunities to seek out precious gold and ores to upgrade your equipment, and find rare items you can trade in each world's marketplace.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/63b50ef7aa1aee0e1d5a3348ebd71093.avif?t=1714651882\" /></div><br><br>As you amass wealth and improve your equipment you will be able to dig deeper and deeper, beating your previous depth records and finding increasingly rare treasure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/ae010655cf70a63b2cbea4976ab70a0b.avif?t=1714651882\" /></div><br><br> \u2022 Use the mouse or keyboard to move, dig and attack monsters<br> \u2022 Mine ores to upgrade your equipment to improve your ability to dig further and fight monsters better<br> \u2022 Find rare items in treasure chests or dropped by monsters to trade in the market<br> \u2022 Buy items low and sell them high in different worlds to make gold for profit<br> \u2022 Spend your gold on upgrades, hats and skins<br> \u2022 Challenge yourself to dig as deep as possible, and beat your own records<br><br>How deep can you dig?",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/6c24889f4e6546010460e650c05fcc7e.poster.avif?t=1714651882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/6c24889f4e6546010460e650c05fcc7e.webm?t=1714651882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/6c24889f4e6546010460e650c05fcc7e.mp4?t=1714651882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dig Down is a fun and challenging digging and treasure-hunting roguelike adventure game.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/b2b6203c90de68aa634b905dedc3531a.avif?t=1714651882\" /></div><br><br>In each world you visit, you must dig as deep as possible before either your pick loses durability and breaks or you run out of time and get crushed. Each dig will see you face increasingly challenging monsters, traps and the opportunities to seek out precious gold and ores to upgrade your equipment, and find rare items you can trade in each world's marketplace.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/63b50ef7aa1aee0e1d5a3348ebd71093.avif?t=1714651882\" /></div><br><br>As you amass wealth and improve your equipment you will be able to dig deeper and deeper, beating your previous depth records and finding increasingly rare treasure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227500/extras/ae010655cf70a63b2cbea4976ab70a0b.avif?t=1714651882\" /></div><br><br> \u2022 Use the mouse or keyboard to move, dig and attack monsters<br> \u2022 Mine ores to upgrade your equipment to improve your ability to dig further and fight monsters better<br> \u2022 Find rare items in treasure chests or dropped by monsters to trade in the market<br> \u2022 Buy items low and sell them high in different worlds to make gold for profit<br> \u2022 Spend your gold on upgrades, hats and skins<br> \u2022 Challenge yourself to dig as deep as possible, and beat your own records<br><br>How deep can you dig?",
